      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Kinda wonder how \"complete\" those world rips are, my world (\"know your friends in space\") has a LOT of custom scripts. \nWhich is how I curb copying since most rippers can't rip the scripts as well...\nBut I don't have site access and I don't really feel like signing up to find out...\nThat all said, this stuff is still highly illegal, the site mentioned before is basically commiting copyright infringement and you could sue them if you made the avatar yourself.",
