      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This kind of thing has been a problem for a long time, with absolutely no official statement on it from the team as far as I am aware. Completely removing the ability to content rip would likely be impossible but surely some methods could be employed to at least attempt to make it more difficult.\nAt bare minimum I would like to see the team actually acknowledge that this is a major problem, and look into methods of stopping or otherwise impeding it. Especially with the creator economy coming soonish, I feel this really needs addressing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
