      "value": "@{6026b24dad4389164dbfa27e|full_name}: Speaking as someone who recently had an avatar stolen and reuploaded, I can tell you they get a fully working package with all scripts intact. This includes AV3 animators that are properly setup. Only thing they don't get are shaders. So aside from shaders, they essentially just slap it into their project and hit upload. It's very unfortunate.",
