      "value": "@{5f2dc3d9b923f7086bb0a2b5|full_name}: Yes - works well for my private avatars. Has only problems with Cloth component or when blendshapes are not set to \"Import\". I have adapted the code, to handle this special cases and also added the decryption feature to other shaders.\nBut I think, this is not a solution for avatar creators/sellers.",
