      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The easy anticheat update literally blocks us from blacklisting our avatars, as the blacklist uses an api to ping vrchat so not only is vrc not doing anything to prevent this, they are proactively keeping it running. this isnt the intent of easy anticheat, but that doesnt change the reality of its repercusions. Please vrc do something about this!",
